Manages a role for the [CloudFoundry (CF) auth method](https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/auth/cf) in Vault.
Roles define the constraints that must be satisfied by a CF instance certificate
at login time, and the token parameters issued on a successful login.

> **Note** Roles can be created independently of the backend configuration,
but a <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`vault.cf.AuthBackendConfig`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`vault.cf.AuthBackendConfig`" pulumi-lang-go="`cf.AuthBackendConfig`" pulumi-lang-python="`cf.AuthBackendConfig`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`vault.cf.AuthBackendConfig`" pulumi-lang-java="`vault.cf.AuthBackendConfig`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`vault_cf_auth_backend_config`">`vault.cf.AuthBackendConfig`</span> must be
in place before any login attempt will succeed.

